00:23:16.280 --> 00:23:20.040
And so providing reminders
and helping keep people on task,

288
00:23:20.120 --> 00:23:22.280
but we probably now call nudging.

289
00:23:23.440 --> 00:23:28.080
Well, that wasn't the phrase then,
