00:23:47.640 --> 00:23:53.440
There isn't a standard way of doing it.
An un-wicked problem is airplane booking.

295
00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:59.600
In its simple version, you have n seats,

296
00:24:00.520 --> 00:24:07.520
and you put people in seats for flights,
