298
00:24:13.480 --> 00:24:17.360
money goes in and money goes
out and you add and subtract.

299
00:24:17.960 --> 00:24:21.200
A wicked problem is one where
you don't know what has to be done.

300
00:24:22.560 --> 00:24:25.200
And we don't know what has to be done.

301
00:24:25.280 --> 00:24:30.800
So we don't know how to…doctors
have this very difficult task,

302
00:24:31.480 --> 00:24:34.960
which one of the things we know
is that they're constantly interrupted.

303
00:24:35.040 --> 00:24:37.640
We don't want to make
those interruptions worse.

